msgstr "إضافة ملاحظة..."

msgid "Club Dashboard"
msgstr "لوحة النادي"

msgid ""
"This is your <strong>Club Dashboard</strong> — every match your club is part "
"of, across\n"
"        every competition, whether your club is hosting or visiting."
msgstr ""
"هذه هي <strong>لوحة النادي</strong> الخاصة بك — كل مباراة يشارك فيها ناديك، "
"في كل البطولات، سواء كان ناديك مضيفًا أو ضيفًا."

msgid ""
"Matches on your own ground are marked \"Responsible for execution\" - you "
"can prepare and submit their tickets and pricing plan. Matches away from "
"your ground are \"Follow-up only\": the host club handles preparation, and "
"you can only track their status here."
msgstr ""

